1) WHAT EXACTLY IS LEADERLESS REPLICATION?
================================================================================

Traditional leader-based:
Client → Leader → Followers

Leaderless:
Client can write to ANY replica.

Example:
N = 3 replicas
Nodes = A, B, C

Write request can go to:
A and B directly

No need:
A → leader → replicate

This is why it is fast globally.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
REAL WORLD USE CASES
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1) Social media likes
2) Product inventory cache
3) User profile replicas
4) Session stores
5) Shopping cart
6) Analytics counters
7) Geo-distributed key-value stores

