2) CORE WORKING — QUORUM BASED REPLICATION
================================================================================

We define:

N = total replicas
W = write acknowledgements needed
R = read acknowledgements needed

Golden rule:
R + W > N

This increases chance that read touches latest write.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
EXAMPLE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

N = 3
W = 2
R = 2

Write:
client sends to A, B, C
A and B ACK
success returned

Read:
client asks A and C
since at least one overlaps with write quorum,
fresh data milne ke high chances.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHY THIS MATTERS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This quorum overlap is the heart of leaderless consistency.

Interview line:
Quorum overlap probabilistically ensures fresh reads without a leader.

