3) INCONSISTENCY EXAMPLE (MOST IMPORTANT)
================================================================================

Initial value on all nodes:
price = 100

Write update:
100 → 120

A = 120
B = 120
C = 100   ← stale because packet drop

Now client reads from:
A and C

Results:
A = 120
C = 100

Now system knows:
some replica is stale.

This directly leads to:
READ REPAIR.

