13) WHY ONLY SEND WRITES, NOT FULL LOG?
================================================================================

Jordan ka line yaha super important hai.

Full replication log problem:
- millions of old writes
- duplicate data transfer
- irrelevant history
- replay overhead

What we really need:
ONLY divergent key ranges

Merkle tree gives:
range-level diff detection.

This is why systems like:
