15) READ REPAIR vs ANTI-ENTROPY
================================================================================

READ REPAIR:
- reactive
- fixes only queried keys
- client-facing path

ANTI-ENTROPY:
- proactive
- background full-range healing
- periodic sync

Best production systems use BOTH.

